This is not dead architecture. `src/market-signal-registry.mjs` imports `normalizeMarketSignal()` and can persist accepted signals into `auditLog`; `src/job-handlers.mjs` exposes that registry through the real `prometheus.signals.ingest` handler. The same job-handler surface also composes downstream genome extraction and commercial reconciliation. Therefore a weakened evidence-class rule can contaminate durable commercial evidence even though it does not itself grant send/spend/payment authority.

Current source is strict today: unknown evidence classes are refused rather than silently downgraded or accepted; `VERIFIED_FACT` requires a source URL; synthetic fixtures cannot carry real source URLs; the normalized registry persists only compact evidence rather than raw provider objects.

Risk classification is P2, not P1: this path writes/feeds internal commercial evidence and can bias ranking/research decisions, but its meaningful operations remain local-preparation and it cannot itself contact a customer, spend, call a provider, or assert cleared revenue. The defect should be closed before market-signal evidence is allowed to become an activation input for consequential distribution.

